flowchart TD
  O[Operator] -->|explicit grant| G[Scoped grant]
  G -->|resource + operations + expiry| A[Agent / tooling]
  A -->|read only| S[Sources]
  A -->|proposal| B[Isolated working branch]
  B --> C{Review}
  C -->|approved| M[Merge authority]
  M --> D{Independent release approval}
  D -->|approved| P[Public deployment]
  C -->|not approved| X[No publication]
